{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2025-01", "window": 2, "start_date": 1736294400, "end_date": 1736985599, "month_true_total": 282, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:54:16 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "185676548", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010088456", "personaname": "ShaDoWLaZeR", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ShaDoWLaZeR/", "num_games_owned": 1684, "num_reviews": 65, "playtime_forever": 6577, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5235, "deck_playtime_at_review": 52, "last_played": 1773789690, "avatar": "0cde96e534b70821ecdc75a3609bd22291aa14bf"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the best roguelikes that keeps being updated to this day, only thing that could use an improvement is character balancing (not fun when a certain squirrel character can blaze through everything with minimal effort) and more endgame content.", "timestamp_created": 1736982726, "timestamp_updated": 1736982726, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.555338382720947266", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185670117", "author": {"steamid": "76561198073916291", "personaname": "JustOneEmperor", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198073916291/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 16012, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 203, "playtime_at_review": 9881, "last_played": 1789669350, "avatar": "81b6f6eb3a5109bfb6618b94ce54007f2fa3a0e5"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the biggest upvotes i have ever given! This game has a lot of characters with a very different playstyles, every run is somewhat different but you can min-max aswell if you want. Since its roguelite, you get currencies to improve passive traits and also unlock new character. For a overview what i like and dislike:\r\nPRO:\r\n- Cool graphics, \r\n- Smooth playstyle, \r\n- Increasing difficulties to give you as much of a challenge as you want. \r\n- So many different weapons for different playstyles\r\n- Every Run is unique\r\nCON:\r\n- So many weapons, you sometimes dont get anything you want early. (probably a good thing tho, to make the game not too stale)\r\n- The descriptions on some chars and abilities lack a little in clarity\r\n- Some of the \"items\" called scrolls are fairly useless unless in specific situations and getting them very early is either win or useless to negative for yourt buiild/character.\r\n- Some of the chars only work well with specific weapons wich is a little annoying to have to force that especially in higher difficulties or Endless mode.\r\n\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1736974932, "timestamp_updated": 1736974932, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185649047", "author": {"steamid": "76561198036200461", "personaname": "StellaCube", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198036200461/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 7990, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7990, "last_played": 1733002369, "avatar": "39695e792fac2ccfb9c3de8dc0d72f250f6bb99e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pretty fun, been playing casually for a few years now, very happy to come back every major update and play for a couple weeks!", "timestamp_created": 1736952505, "timestamp_updated": 1736952505, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_co